    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/4137abf6-25b5-4291-ac44-7a9ad379200a-image.png\" style=\"width: 146px; height: 140px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>g</mi></msub></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/9d48137a-0230-46ec-a8d6-1a19720e0957-image.png\" style=\"width: 225px; height: 180px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>From the above diagram, velocity of the raindrop wrt ground will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mi>r</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>And velocity of the raindrop wrt the moving girl will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
